   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>I LOCE COCAINE</p>\n<p>Jokes aside, great idea! Now that I think about it, it doesn\u2019t make a lick of sense that there aren\u2019t any drugs circulating in Tarkov as seen in vanilla. It was a center of international trade and shady corpo dealings before the colapse, and now it has turned into a lawless hellscape. People ought to be rolling in the stuff!<br />\nFor future updates and additions, consider adding snus. Because 1. It has a funny name, and 2. it\u2019s a popular highschool and college party drug in the post-soviet space.</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
